    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <style>
        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            height: 100%;
            padding: 0;
            min-width: 300px;
        }

        html {
            --timeline-width: 2px;
            --timeline-height: 0.05em;
            --timeline-color-arround: rgb(144, 201, 255);
            --block-verbose-border: 0em;
            --block-verbose-shadow: 0 1px 3px #999;
            --radio-active: #37474f;
            --radio-inactive: #6c757d;
            --page-link-background: white;
            --timeline-color: #2196f3;
            --bottom-background-color: #fafafafa;
            --bottom-color: #222 !important;
            --bottom-border: 1px solid #222;
            --green: green !important;
            --opcode-background-color: whitesmoke;
            --search-green: green;
            --adv-background-color: white;
            --adv-background-line: #ddd;
            --green-amount-tail-zero: #a5d6a7 !important;
            --red-amount-tail-zero: #F6A3A3 !important;
            --block-verbose-background: #f7f7f7;
            --footer-background-color: #1a1a1a;
            --footer-link-color: #888880;
            --theme: "\f186";
            --card-title-color: #6f6f6f;
            --body-background-color: #f1f1f1;
            --map-dot-color: #2196f3;
            --body-color: #444;
            --map-background-color: whitesmoke;
            --card-background-color: white;
            --card-border: 0em;
            --map-border-color: silver;
            --card-border-shadow: 0 1px 3px #999;
            --card-text-color: black;
            --card-line-color: #f1f1f1;
            --footer-line-color: #888;
            --footer-text-color: #888;
            --header-background-color: #14417a;
            --grid-line-color: silver;
            --bar-color: rgb(124, 181, 236);
            --link-color: #337AB7;
            --label-color: #555;
            --card-border-color: silver;
            --card-element-hover: #f1f1f1;
            --select-color: rgb(169, 222, 255);
            --bg-ltg: #bbffbe;
            --page-link-color: #007bff;
            --page-link-border-color: #dee2e6;
            --page-link-active-color: #007bff;
            --value-color: black;
        }

        html[data-theme='dark'] {
            --timeline-color-arround: rgb(81, 66, 40);
            --timeline-width: 1px;
            --timeline-height: 0.10em;
            --block-verbose-shadow: none;
            --radio-active: #014c8e;
            --radio-inactive: #37474f;
            --page-link-background: #37474f;
            --page-link-color: white;
            --block-number: white !important;
            --block-verbose-border: 0.05em solid #38444d;
            --timeline-color: rgb(255, 174, 1);
            --bottom-background-color: transparent;
            --bottom-color: #38444d;
            --bottom-border: 1px solid #38444d;
            --green: rgb(114, 248, 120) !important;
            --red-amount-tail-zero: #e57373 !important;
            --map-background-color: #555f6b;
            --block-verbose-background: #111922;
            --map-border-color: #444;
            --map-dot-color: #ff810c;
            --body-background-color: #010d15;
            --body-color: #d1d1d1;
            --card-background-color: #021624;
            --card-border-color: #38444d;
            --card-border: 0.05em solid #38444d;
            --card-title-color: white;
            --card-border-shadow: None;
            --card-line-color: #38444d;
            --card-text-color: #a5a5a5;
            --adv-background-color: #182430;
            --adv-background-line: #38444d;
            --header-background-color: #031a2a;
            --footer-link-color: #8899a6;
            --footer-background-color: #031a2a;
            --footer-line-color: #38444d;
            --footer-text-color: #8899a6;
            --grid-line-color: #38444d;
            --label-color: #8899a6;
            --value-color: #f2f2f2;
            --link-color: #00aaf8;
            --bar-color: rgb(19, 77, 166);
            --card-element-hover: #242a33;
            --search-bar-background: #052339;
            --search-bar-shadow: None;
            --theme: "\f185";
            --green-amount-tail-zero: #1d631f !important;
            --select-color: #a1016c;
            --bg-ltg: #213f5d;
            --page-link-border-color: #191c23;
            --page-link-active-color: #014c8e;
        }

        .page-item.active .page-link {
            background-color: var(--page-link-active-color);
            border-color: var(--page-link-active-color);
        }

        .text-block {
            background-color: var(--adv-background-color);
            color: var(--value-color);
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        html.color-theme-in-transition,
        html.color-theme-in-transition *,
        html.color-theme-in-transition *:before,
        html.color-theme-in-transition *:after {
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        ::selection {
            background: var(--select-color); /* WebKit/Blink Browsers */
        }

        ::-moz-selection {
            background: var(--select-color); /* Gecko Browsers */
        }

        .theme:before {
            content: var(--theme);
        }

        .text-orange {
            color: #ff810c !important;
            font-size: 4em;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0 !important;;
            color: var(--body-color);
            min-width: 300px;
            min-height: 100%;
            background-color: var(--body-background-color);
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;

            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;

        }

        a {
            color: var(--link-color);

        }

        a:hover {
            color: var(--link-color);
        }

        .bottom_n {
            cursor: pointer;
            background-color: var(--bottom-background-color);
            color: var(--bottom-border) !important;
            border: var(--bottom-border);
        }

        .dropdown-item {
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .bg-light-green {
            background-color: var(--bg-ltg) !important;
        }

        .text-darkgray {
            color: #222 !important;
        }

        .text-bitaps-blue {
            color: #337AB7 !important;
        }

        .text-gray {
            color: gray !important;
        }

        .text-gray2 {
            color: #5a5a5a !important;
        }

        .text-silver {
            color: silver !important;
        }

        .text-black {
            color: black !important;
        }

        .text-green {
            color: #4CAF50 !important;
        }

        .text-white {
            color: white !important;
        }

        .text-softred {
            color: #e55 !important;
        }

        .text-red {
            color: #d93c3c !important;
        }

        .text-blue {
            color: #0066ff;
        }

        .text-blue-smoke {
            color: #6299D3;
        }

        .text-yellow {
            color: #f7931a !important;
        }

        #sticky {
            position: sticky;
        }

        .footer {
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .content {
            flex: 1 0 auto;
        }

        a:focus,
        button:focus,
        input:focus,
        textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #d0d5d8 !important;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: white !important;
        }

        .upBtn {
            -moz-transform: rotate(180deg);

            -webkit-transform: rotate(180deg);
            transform: rotate(180deg);

            border: 0em; /* Remove borders */
            border-radius: 0.5em; /* Remove borders */
            background-color: transparent;
            cursor: pointer; /* Add a mouse pointer on hover */

        }

        .upBtn-wrap {
            border-radius: 0.5em; /* Remove borders */
            background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            display: none; /* Hidden by default */
            position: fixed; /* Fixed/sticky position */
            padding: 0.5em;
            bottom: 1em; /* Place the button at the bottom of the page */
            right: 1em; /* Place the button 30px from the right */
            z-index: 99; /* Make sure it does not overlap */
        }

        .header {
            background-color: white;
            float: none;
            font-family: 'lattow', sans-serif;
            width: 100%;
            border: 0em white;
        }

        .header-sticky {
            position: sticky;
            padding: 0em;
            background-color: var(--search-bar-background);
            margin-top: -0.1em;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .page-link {
            border: 1px solid var(--page-link-border-color);
            color: var(--page-link-color);
            background-color: var(--page-link-background);
        }

        .market {
            min-width: 12.1em;
            margin: 0.5em;
            color: white !important;
            /*margin-bottom: 2.5em;*/
        }

        .img_small {
            height: 2em;
            width: 2em;
            margin: 0.3em;
            display: inline-block;
            background-size: 100%, 100%;
        }

        .bottom-line {
            border-bottom: 0.04em solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        #clock {
            background: #131f31;
        }

        #footer {
            background-color: var(--footer-background-color);
            color: white;
        }

        #footer a {
            color: var(--footer-link-color);

            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        #footer a:visited {
            color: var(--footer-link-color);

        }

        #footer a:hover {
            color: white;

        }

        input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
        input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
            /* display: none; <- Crashes Chrome on hover */
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            margin: 0; /* <-- Apparently some margin are still there even though it's hidden */
        }

        input:focus {
            outline: none;
        }

        input[type=radio] {
            position: absolute;
            visibility: hidden;
            display: none;
        }

        label {
            color: white;
            display: inline-block;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: var(--radio-inactive);

            padding: 0.2em 0.8em;
            margin-bottom: 0em;
        }

        input[type=radio]:checked + label {

            background: var(--radio-active);
        }

        .radio-group {
            /*border: solid 0.1em #675f6b;*/
            display: inline-block !important;
            background: var(--radio-inactive);
            border-radius: 0.3em;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .delta-negative {
            color: #4CAF50;
        }

        .rc-anchor-light {
            background-color: transparent !important;
        }

        .header-sticky > nav {
            padding: 0.2em 0.5em;
        }

        .nav-link {
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .green {
            /*color:#4CAF50 !important;*/
            color: var(--green);
        }

        .green .amount-tail-zerro {
            color: var(--green-amount-tail-zero);
        }

        .list-inline {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .header-top {
            text-shadow: 0rem 0rem 0.02em #000000;
            color: white;

            background: #131f31;

            z-index: 1100;
        }


        .powered {
            margin-left: 1em;
            display: inline-block;
            padding-top: 0.5em;
            width: 4.5em;
            height: 2em;
            font-size: 0.6em;
            background-position: bottom;

            background-size: 100%;
            background-repeat: no-repeat, no-repeat;
        }

        .jsbtc {
            background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,');
            width: 4.7em;
            height: 3.2em;
            padding-bottom: 0.25em;
            margin-bottom: 0.20em;

        }

        .logo-wrap {
            max-width: 2.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.75em;
            margin-bottom: 0.4em;
        }

        .menu-picto-wrap {
            max-width: 3.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.7em;
            margin-bottom: 0.4em;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .moon {
            max-width: 8.5rem;
            font-size: 0.6em;

        }

        button {
            font-family: 'gill', 'Helvetica', sans-serif !important;
            cursor: pointer !important;
        }

        .menu {
            height: 1.5rem !important;
            margin-top: 0.4em !important;
        }

        .elipsis {
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }



        .search-box-wrap {
            padding: 0em;
            font-size: 1.2em;

        }

        .search-box-wrap input {
            color: var(--body-color);
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: 'gill';

        }

        /* latin-ext */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'lattow2';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: 'roboto';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* latin-ext */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'lattow1';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* latin-ext */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'lattow';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 100;
        }

        .timeline-time {
            padding-left: 0.3em;
            /*font-family: 'mono', sans-serif!important;*/
            font-weight: bold !important;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            /*color: #555 !important;*/
        }

        .label {
            color: var(--label-color);
        }

        .block-number a {
            color: var(--block-number);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 70em;
            margin: 0 auto;
            list-style-type: none;
            padding-left: 13em;
        }

        .btn-copy {

            font-size: 0.6em !important;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            width: var(--timeline-width);
            height: 100%;

            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            content: "";
            left: 10.05em;
            top: 1em;
            background-image: linear-gradient(to top, transparent 0px, var(--timeline-color) 10%, var(--timeline-color) 10%, var(--timeline-color) 70%);
        }

        .timeline li {
            position: relative;
            display: block;
            border: var(--block-verbose-border);
            box-shadow: var(--block-verbose-shadow);
            background-color: var(--block-verbose-background);
        }

        .timeline .time-date {
            position: absolute;
            left: -13em;
            top: 0.3em;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 1em !important;
        }

        .timeline .blocks {
            margin-bottom: 2em;
            padding: 1em;
        }

        .timeline li::after {
            width: 1.5em;
            height: 1.5em;
            left: -3.7em;
            top: 0.4em;
            display: block;
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            background-color: var(--timeline-color);
            border-radius: 100%;
            border-width: 0.5rem;
            border-style: solid;
            border-color: var(--timeline-color-arround);
            border-image: initial;
        }

        .p-name {
            color: var(--label-color);
            font-family: sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            font-weight: 300;

        }

        .z-name {
            color: var(--label-color);
            font-weight: 400;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .p-value {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            color: var(--value-color) !important;

        }

        .p-value small {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            color: var(--value-color) !important;

        }

        .p-value-hex {
            color: #777 !important;

        }

        .p-value small {
            color: var(--value-color);

        }

        .font-bd {
            font-size: 0.8em;

            margin-left: 0.4em;
        }

        .amount-tail-zerro {
            color: #AAA;
        }

        .countdown-section b {
            font-size: 1.4em;
            display: block;
        }

        .countdown-section {
            text-align: center;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .countdown-section:last-child {
            border-right: none;
        }

        .dashboard-card {
            height: 22em;
        }

        .dashboard {

            font-size: 1em;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        }

        .lattolight {
            font-family: 'lattow', sans-serif;
        }

        .lattobold {
            font-family: 'lattow2', sans-serif;
        }

        .bold {
            font-weight: bold !important;
        }

        .lattomidle {
            font-family: 'lattow1', sans-serif;
        }

        .fast-menu {
            font-size: 1em;
            font-weight: 300;

        }

        .max-size {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .menu-pallete a {
            color: #888;
        }

        .menu-pallete a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        /* latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Raleway';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: "Droid";
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        input[placeholder] {
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        input::-moz-placeholder {
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        input:-moz-placeholder {
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        input:-ms-input-placeholder {
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }


        #collapse-menu-net a {
            font-size: 0.6em;
        }

        .after-dot {
            font-size: 0.8em;
        }

        .bitcoin-logo-menu {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        body {
            /*background-color: #f1f1f1!important;*/
            margin: 0;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none !important;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1090px) {
            .dashboard > div {
                max-width: 100% !important;
                font-size: 1em !important;
            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 1010px) {
            .dashboard-card {
                height: 24em;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 920px) {


            #htop-left, #htop-left-wrap, #market-dashboard,
            #htop-left-wrapper {
                width: 100% !important;
            }

            #htop-left-wrapper, #clock > h3 {

                margin: 0px auto !important;
                padding-left: 0em !important;
                padding-right: 0em !important;

            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 780px) {
            .dashboard > div {
                max-width: 100% !important;
                font-size: 1em;

            }



            #lang {
                display: none;
            }

            .dashboard-card {
                height: 21em;
            }

            #market-dashboard {
                padding-bottom: 1em;
                height: 24em;
            }

            .header-top {
                background-size: 200%;
            }

            #collapse-menu {

            }

        }

        .disable-select {
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -moz-user-select: none;
            -ms-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .shadow-black {

            box-shadow: 0 2px 4px black;

        }

        .menu-toggle {
            margin-left: 0.5em;
            font-weight: 100;
            font-size: 0.6em;

        }

        .menu-toggle .fa {
            vertical-align: 0 !important;
        }

        @media (max-width: 575px) {

            .dashboard > div {
                max-width: 100% !important;
                font-size: 1em;

            }



            #htop-left {
                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            .top-stat-helper {
                display: none;
            }

            .dashboard-card {
                height: 22em;
            }

            .header-top {
                background-size: 250%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {

            #average_last_top {
                display: none;
            }

            #last_block_header {
                min-width: 15em !important;
            }

            #price-header {
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1199px) {

            .header > div {
                width: 100%;
            }

        }

        .mono {
            font-family: Droid, monospace !important;
        }

        .smaller {
            font-size: 0.9em !important;
        }

        .roboto {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif !important;
        }

        .card-wrapper {

            display: flex;

            flex-direction: column;

        }

        .card-wrapper th {
            font-weight: lighter !important;
        }

        .card-footer {
            font-family: 'lattow', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--card-background-color);
            border-radius: 0em;
            border: var(--card-border);
            border-color: var(--card-border-color);
            box-shadow: var(--card-border-shadow);
            border-top: 0px;
            padding-bottom: 0.5em;
            padding-top: 0.5em;
            max-width: 100%;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .card-table {
            margin-bottom: 0em;
            color: var(--card-text-color);
        }

        .close-warning {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .card-table th {
            border-top: 0em;

            padding: 0.3em !important;

        }

        .border-b {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border-color);
        }

        .no-break {
            word-break: keep-all;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .ellipsis {
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;

        }

        .card-table td {
            margin: 0;
            vertical-align: bottom;
            border-color: var(--card-border-color) !important;
            padding-bottom: 0.1em;
        }

        .card-title {
            color: var(--card-title-color);
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            padding-top: 0.2em;
            margin-bottom: 0.2em;
            margin-left: 0.7em;
            font-size: 0.8em;
        }

        .card-body {
            font-family: 'lattow', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--card-background-color);
            border-color: var(--card-border-color);
            padding: 1.38em;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--card-border-shadow);
            border: var(--card-border);
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .container-fluid {
            max-width: 1300px;
        }

        .arrow-container {
            display: block;
            z-index: 100;
            width: 1.5em;
            height: 2em;

        }

        .arrow-container:hover {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .arrow-container:hover .arrowx {
            opacity: 0.8;
            top: 100%;
            margin-top: -80%;
        }

        .arrow-container:hover .arrowx:before {
            top: 100%;
            /*transform: translate(100%, 100%) rotateZ(-45deg);*/
        }

        .arrow-container:hover .arrowx:after {
            top: 100%;
            /*transform: translate(100%, 100%) rotateZ(45deg);*/
        }

        .arrowx {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .arrowx:before, .arrowx:after {
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            content: '';
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            transform-origin: bottom right;
            background: #fff;
            width: 0.1em;
            height: 1em;
            border-radius: 0.05em;
            transform: translate(0%, 0%) rotateZ(-45deg);
        }

        .arrowx:after {
            transform-origin: bottom left;
            transform: translate(0%, 0%) rotateZ(45deg);
        }

        .arrowx:nth-child(1) {
            opacity: 0.1;
            top: -10%;
        }

        .arrowx:nth-child(2) {
            opacity: 0.4;
            top: 15%;
        }

        .arrowx:nth-child(3) {
            opacity: 0.7;
            top: 100%;
            margin-top: -80%;
        }

        .arrow-container-black .arrowx:before {
            background-color: #222;
        }

        .arrow-container-black .arrowx:after {
            background-color: #222;
        }
    </style>

    
    <style>

        html {
            --text-area-background: rgb(247, 247, 247);
            --text-area-disabled-border: #bdbdbd;
            --text-area-disabled-background: #fafafa;
            --text-area-placeholder: #bbb;
            --text-area-border: 0;
            --x-btn-position: 0 0;
        }

        html[data-theme='dark'] {
            --text-area-disabled-background: transparent;
            --text-area-background: transparent;
            --text-area-placeholder: #2f434d;
            --text-area-border: 0.05em solid #7a7a7a !important;
            --text-area-disabled-border: #232d36;

            --x-btn-position: 100% 100%;
        }

        .dice {
            width: 1.5em;
            height: 1.5em;
            background-color: transparent;
            background-size: 100%, 100%;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
        }

        .word {
            font-size: 1.3em;

            width: 6em;
            padding-left: 1em;
        }

        .dice_1 {
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;base64,");
        }

        .dice_2 {
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
        }

        .dice_3 {
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
        }

        .dice_4 {
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;base64,")
        }

        .dice_5 {
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
        }

        .dice_6 {
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
        }

        .dices {
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
            height: auto;
        }

        .d-a-wrap {
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        #dice-map {
            padding: 1em;
            background-color: var(--card-background-color) !important;

        }

        #dice-map-wrapper {
            height: 2568em;
        }

        .share {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 1em;
            word-break: keep-all;
            background-color: var(--block-verbose-background);
            color: var(--body-color);
            padding: 0.5em;
        }

        .share-div {
            width: 100%;
        }

        p {
            text-align: justify;
            text-justify: inter-word;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            margin-left: 0.8em;
            margin-right: 0.8em;
            font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
        }

        #fswl {
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 0.1em solid;
            padding: 0.1em;
            padding-top: 0.2em;
            border-radius: 0.2em;
        }

        .d-path-w {
            font-size: 0.6em !important;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1070px) {

            #dice-map-wrapper {
                height: auto;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1180px) {

            .d-a-wrap {
                flex-direction: column !important;
                align-items: center;
                width: auto !important;
            }

            .addrs-w {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .d-addr {
                font-size: 1.15em;
            }

            .h-d-addr-1 {
                width: auto !important;
            }

            .h-d-addr {
                align-items: center;

            }

            .wst {
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }

            .d-address-w, .h-d-addr {
                justify-content: center !important;
            }

            .h-d-keys {
                display: none !important;

            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 950px) {

            #mnemonic-info, #mnemonic-shares {
                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            #load-restored-code {
                margin-top: 3em !important;
                margin-left: 0em !important;
            }

            #js-generator {
                padding-top: 5em;
                padding-bottom: 4em;
            }

            #load-code {

                padding-top: 2em;
            }

            #shares-wrap {
                padding: 0em !important;
            }

            #path-standard .items {
                flex-direction: column !important;
                align-items: center !important;
                margin-top: 1em;
                text-align: center !important;

            }

            #derive-path-wrap {
                margin-top: 2em !important;
            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 750px) {
            .dvp-2 {
                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            .derive-acc-label {
                margin-top: 2em;
            }

            .path-standard {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .d-address-w {
                justify-content: start !important;
                flex-direction: column !important;
                align-items: start !important;
                overflow: hidden;

                padding-bottom: 0.3em;
                padding-top: 0.3em;
                width: auto !important;

            }

            .d-path {
                font-size: 0.8em !important;
                margin: 0 !important;
            }

            .d-path-w {
                width: 100%;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: start !important;
            }

            .h-d-addr {
                display: none !important;
            }

            #addresses {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                width: auto;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .d-address-w {
                margin-top: 0.5em !important;
            }

            #mnemonic-option {
                padding-left: 0 !important;
                padding-right: 0 !important;
            }

            #mnemonic-option .items,
            #mnemonic-account-option .items {
                flex-direction: column !important;
                align-items: start !important;
                margin-top: 1em;
            }

            #bip32-path-input-w {
                width: 100% !important;
                display: flex !important;

                justify-content: center;
            }

            .d-address-w {
                overflow: initial;
            }

            #mnemonic-option .items .items-btn,
            #derive-path-wrap {
                width: 100% !important;
                display: flex !important;

                justify-content: center;
                margin-top: 1em;
                margin-left: 0 !important;

            }

            #derive-path-wrap {
                margin-top: 2em;
            }

            #derive-path-w {
                margin-top: 0;
                margin-bottom: 1.5em !important;
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            .d-a-wrap {
                padding-right: 0 !important;
            }

            #chain-label {
                margin-top: 1em !important;
                margin-bottom: 1em !important;
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            #path-standard {
                margin-bottom: 2.5em;
            }

            .wst {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .h-d-addr {
                display: none !important;
            }

            #count-selector {
                align-items: center;

                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            #content-wrapper, #content-wrapper .container-fluid, #addresses, .d-a-wrap, .addrs-w, .wst {
                padding-left: 0em !important;
                padding-right: 0em !important;
            }

            #load-code-control, .dvp-2 {
                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            #load-code-status {
                margin-bottom: 1em;

            }

            #load-code-control div {
                text-align: center !important;
            }

            #dice-map {
                font-size: 0.8em;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 530px) {
            .d-a-wrap {
                font-size: 0.85em !important;
                margin: 0 !important;
                padding-bottom: 0.5em;
                padding-top: 0.5em;
                width: 100% !important;
            }

            .d-addr, .addrs-w {
                text-align: left !important;
                padding-left: 0 !important;
            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .d-a-wrap {
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }

            #dice-map {
                font-size: 0.6em;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .wst small {
                display: none !important;
            }

            .d-a-wrap {
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 350px) {

            .d-a-wrap {
                font-size: 0.75em !important;
            }
        }

        textarea {

            text-align: justify;
            outline: none !important;
            min-height: 3.2em;
            -webkit-writing-mode: horizontal-tb !important;
            text-rendering: auto;
            letter-spacing: normal;
            word-spacing: normal;
            text-transform: none;

            text-shadow: none;
            display: inline-block;

            -webkit-appearance: textarea;

            -webkit-rtl-ordering: logical;

            cursor: text;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            overflow-wrap: break-word;
            margin: 0em;

            border-image: initial;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            direction: ltr;
            border: none;

            -moz-box-sizing: border-box;
            -webkit-box-sizing: border-box;

            font-family: 'Roboto', arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 0.8em;
            padding-right: 2em;
            resize: none;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: var(--card-border-shadow);
            word-break: keep-all;
            background-color: var(--text-area-background);
            color: var(--body-color);
            border: var(--text-area-border);
            border-radius: 0.15em;
        }

        .share-index {
            width: 2.8em;
            text-align: center;
            height: 2em;
            padding: 0.7em !important;
            padding-top: 1.25em !important;
            padding-bottom: 1.25em !important;

            font-family: 'Roboto', arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            background-color: var(--text-area-background);
            color: var(--body-color);
            border: var(--text-area-border);
            box-shadow: var(--card-border-shadow);
            border-radius: 0.3em;
        }

        textarea::-webkit-input-placeholder {
            color: var(--text-area-placeholder);
        }

        textarea:-moz-placeholder { /* Firefox 18- */
            color: var(--text-area-placeholder);
        }

        textarea::-moz-placeholder { /* Firefox 19+ */
            color: var(--text-area-placeholder);
        }

        textarea:-ms-input-placeholder {
            color: var(--text-area-placeholder);
        }

        textarea::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-area-placeholder);
        }

        .x-btn {
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            display: inline-block;
            height: 1.5em !important;
            width: 1.5em !important;
            background-image: url("data:image/png;base64,");
            background-size: cover;
            opacity: .55 !important;
            background-position: var(--x-btn-position);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .x-btn:hover {
            opacity: 1 !important;
        }

        .remove-share {
            margin: 0.7em;
            margin-left: 2em;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        textarea:disabled, .span-label, .share-index:disabled {

            background-color: var(--text-area-disabled-background) !important;
            border: 0.08em solid var(--text-area-disabled-border);
            box-shadow: None;

        }

        #shares-wrap {
            padding-right: 4em;
            padding-left: 4em;
        }

        #mnemonic-option {
            padding-right: 4em;
            padding-left: 4em;
        }

        #addresses {
            font-family: Droid, monospace, sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            padding: 1em;
            padding-top: 0em;
        }

        .d-pub {
            font-size: 0.85em;
        }

        .d-address-w {
            margin-top: 1.4em;
            margin-bottom: 0.4em;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-line-color);
        }

        .d-priv {
            color: green !important;
        }

        .wst small {
            color: silver !important;

            padding-right: 0.2em;

        }

        .d-path {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Roboto', arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 0.7em !important;
            color: var(--body-color);
            border: 0.05em solid var(--text-area-disabled-border);
            border-radius: 0.3em;
        }

        .load-more {
            color: #007bff;
            cursor: pointer;

        }

    </style>


</head>

<body >
<div class="content  ">
    
        <div id="theme-swith" class="moon m-3 btn btn-outline-secondary  ">
           Dark
        </div>

    

    


    <div id="content-wrapper" class="container-fluid col-xl-11 pt-2 pb-4 mb-4 d-flex flex-column w-100 smaller"
         style="flex: auto;">

        <h5 class="text-center">Bitcoin mnemonic tool</h5>
        <!-- first screen  create/load mnemonic -->
        <div id="gen-tools-wrap">

            <!-- JS Generator -->
            <div id="auto-tools" class="container-fluid col-xl-11 pt-2 pb-2 d-flex flex-row zoom-out w-100">
                <div class="card-wrapper  w-100">
                    <div class="card-title">Generator/Loader</div>
                    <div class="card-body pb-4" style="overflow: initial;   ">

                        <div id="address-div" class="d-flex   flex-row ">
                            <h4>
                                <small class="p-name">Mnemonic code</small>
                            </h4>
                        </div>

                        <div id="mnemonic-info" class="d-flex  pt-2 flex-row   justify-content-between ">
                            <div id="load-code" class=" d-flex   flex-column  justify-content-between w-100 mt-2  ">
                                <div class="position-relative">
                                     <textarea id="mnemonic-input" class="w-100" name="load-mnemonic" maxlength="216"
                                               placeholder="Example: crush cattle vast ..."
                                               style="height: 2.45em;"
                                               spellcheck="false"
                                               onkeyup="textAreaAdjust(this,'#load-code-status');"></textarea>
                                    <div class="x-btn position-absolute"
                                         onclick="deleteAreaContent(this, '#load-code-status');"
                                         style="right: 0.3em;top:0.7em; display: none;"></div>
                                </div>


                                <div id="load-code-control"
                                     class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-end  align-items-center pt-4">
                                    <div class="w-100 mr-2 ">
                                        <div id="load-code-status"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-end  align-items-center">

                                        <button id="adjust-code-btn" type="button" onclick="adjust_checksum();"
                                                class="btn btn-warning mr-2" style="display: none;">Adjust checksum
                                        </button>
                                        <button id="force-load-code-btn" type="button" onclick="ignore_checksum();"
                                                class="btn btn-primary mr-2" style="display: none;">Ignore checksum
                                        </button>
                                        <button id="split-code-btn" type="button" disabled onclick="split_mnemonic();"
                                                class="btn btn-outline-secondary mr-2">Split
                                        </button>
                                        <button id="load-code-btn" type="button" disabled onclick="load_mnemonic();"
                                                class="btn btn-primary">Load
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- generator -->
                            <div id="js-generator"
                                 class=" d-flex mt-2  flex-column  justify-content-end align-items-bottom w-100">
                                <div id="count-selector"
                                     class=" d-flex   flex-row  align-items-center justify-content-center  w-100 mb-4">
                                    <div><h6 class="mr-4   align-items-center">Words count:</h6></div>
                                    <div style="font-size: 1.1em;">
                                        <div class="radio-group mr-2 d-inline-block">

                                            <input type="radio" id="option-12" name="selector_12"
                                                   onclick="switch_words('12');">
                                            <label for="option-12">12</label>
                                            <input type="radio" id="option-15" name="selector_15"
                                                   onclick="switch_words('15');">
                                            <label for="option-15">15</label>
                                            <input type="radio" id="option-18" name="selector_18"
                                                   onclick="switch_words('18');">
                                            <label for="option-18">18</label>
                                            <input type="radio" id="option-21" name="selector_21"
                                                   onclick="switch_words('21');">
                                            <label for="option-21">21</label>
                                            <input type="radio" id="option-24" checked="checked" name="selector_24"
                                                   onclick="switch_words('24');">
                                            <label for="option-24">24</label>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-center smaller">
                                    JavaScript safe generation with NIST randomness tests.
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center   pt-4">
                                    <button id="gen-mnemonic-btn" type="button" disabled onclick="generate_mnemonic();"
                                            class="btn btn-primary">
                                        Generate new
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Split tool -->
            <div id="split-shamir-tools" style="display: none;">
                <div class="container-fluid col-xl-11 pt-2 pb-2 d-flex flex-row zoom-out w-100">
                    <div id="d-flex flex-row " class="card-wrapper  w-100">
                        <div class="card-title">Mnemonic split</div>
                        <div class="card-body pb-4" style="overflow: initial;   ">

                            <div id="address-div" class="d-flex   flex-row ">
                                <h4>
                                    <small class="p-name">Split to shares</small>
                                </h4>
                            </div>

                            <textarea id="mnemonic-split" class="w-100 mt-4 mb-4"
                                      style="height: 2.45em;"
                                      spellcheck="false"
                                      disabled
                                      onkeyup="textAreaAdjust(this,'#load-code-status');"></textarea>

                            <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center">
                                <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                    Mnemonic secret sharing schema threshold
                                    <input id="share-threshold" class="share-index m-2" value="2"> of
                                    <input id="share-total" class="share-index m-2" value="3"> shares.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex flex-column  justify-content-center mt-3 mb-2">
                                <div id="calc-status"
                                     style="min-height: 1em; min-width: 20em;text-align: center;"></div>
                                <div class="text-center mt-3">
                                    <button id="calc-shares-btn" type="button" onclick="calc_shares();"
                                            class="btn btn-primary ">Calculate
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="shares-wrap" class="mt-4" style="display: none;">
                                    <div class="d-flex flex-row  justify-content-start align-items-center w-100 ">
                                        <h6 class="m-1 text-center" style="flex-grow: 1;">Mnemonic secret share</h6>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="splitted-shares" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-between w-100">
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Restore tool -->
            <div id="auto-shamir-tools" class="container-fluid col-xl-11 pt-2 pb-2 d-flex flex-row zoom-out w-100">
                <div id="d-flex flex-row " class="card-wrapper  w-100">
                    <div class="card-title">Mnemonic restore</div>
                    <div class="card-body pb-4" style="overflow: initial;   ">
                        <div id="address-div" class="d-flex   flex-row ">
                            <h4>
                                <small class="p-name">Restore from shares</small>
                            </h4>
                        </div>

                        <div id="mnemonic-shares" class="d-flex    flex-row   justify-content-between w-100">
                            <div id="restore-code"
                                 class=" d-flex   flex-row  justify-content-around align-items-end w-100 pl-2 pr-2   pb-2 "
                                 style="flex-flow: row wrap;">
                                <div class="d-flex flex-row  justify-content-start align-items-center w-100 mt-3 ">
                                    <h6 class="m-1 text-center" style="flex-grow: 1;">Mnemonic share</h6>
                                </div>
                                <div id="shares" class=" d-flex   flex-column justify-content-between w-100 mt-2">
                                    <!-- first share -->
                                    <div id="share-1" class="share-div d-flex flex-row align-items-top w-100 mt-2">
                                        <div class="position-relative w-100 ml-3">
                                             <textarea id="share-input-1" class="w-100"
                                                       maxlength="216"

                                                       style="height: 2.45em;"
                                                       spellcheck="false"
                                                       onpaste="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"
                                                       onkeyup="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"
                                                       onchange="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"></textarea>
                                            <div class="x-btn position-absolute"
                                                 onclick="deleteAreaContent(this, '#restore-status');"
                                                 style="right: 0.3em;top:0.7em; display: none;"></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="del-share-1" class="remove-share position-relative">
                                            <i class="position-absolute fa fa-minus mt-1 text-silver"
                                               style="left: 0em; color: transparent!important;"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <!-- second share -->
                                    <div id="share-2" class="share-div d-flex flex-row align-items-top w-100 mt-4">
                                        <div class="position-relative w-100 ml-3">
                                             <textarea id="share-input-2" class="w-100"
                                                       maxlength="216"

                                                       style="height: 2.45em;"
                                                       spellcheck="false"
                                                       onpaste="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"
                                                       onkeyup="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"
                                                       onkchange="textAreaAdjust(this,'#restore-status', '#shares');"></textarea>
                                            <div class="x-btn position-absolute"
                                                 onclick="deleteAreaContent(this, '#restore-status');"
                                                 style="right: 0.3em;top:0.7em; display: none;"></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="del-share-2" class="remove-share position-relative">
                                            <i class="position-absolute fa fa-minus mt-1 text-silver"
                                               style="left: 0em;color: transparent!important;"></i>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                </div>

                                <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-end align-items-center    w-100"
                                     style="margin-top: 2.2em;margin-right: 2.7em;">
                                    <div class="text-left w-100">
                                        <div id="restore-status"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="add_share();" class="btn btn-outline-secondary  ">+
                                        add share
                                    </button>
                                    <button id="restore-btn" type="button" disabled onclick="restore();"
                                            class="btn btn-primary ml-2  ">Restore
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div id="load-restored-code"
                                 class=" d-flex   flex-column  justify-content-between  w-100 mt-4 ml-4 ">
                                <div>
                                    To recover the mnemonic code, it is necessary to use the minimum number of secret
                                    shares in accordance with the threshold secret sharing schema.
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="position-relative">
                                         <textarea id="restored-result" class="w-100" name="load-mnemonic"
                                                   maxlength="216"
                                                   placeholder=""
                                                   style="height: 2.45em;"
                                                   spellcheck="false"
                                                   disabled
                                                   onpaste="textAreaAdjust(this,'#load-code-status');"
                                                   onkeyup="textAreaAdjust(this,'#load-code-status');"
                                                   onchange="textAreaAdjust(this,'#load-code-status');"></textarea>

                                    </div>

                                    <div id="load-restored-code-control"
                                         class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-end  align-items-center pt-4 mt-3">
                                        <div class="w-100 mr-2 bold">
                                            <div id="load-restored-code-status" class="text-left"></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-end  align-items-center">

                                            <button id="load-restored-code-btn" type="button" disabled
                                                    onclick="load_restored_mnemonic();"
                                                    class="btn btn-primary">Load
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>


            </div>

            <!-- Dice wordlist -->
            <div id="address" class="container-fluid col-xl-11 pt-2 pb-2 d-flex flex-row zoom-out w-100">
                <div class="card-wrapper  w-100">
                    <div class="card-title">Offline generation</div>
                    <div class="card-body pb-4" style="word-break:  keep-all !important;overflow: initial;   ">
                        <div id="address-div" class="d-flex   flex-row ">
                            <div class="dice dices mr-3" style="font-size: 1.5em;"></div>
                            <h4>
                                <small class="p-name">Dice generation</small>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="mnemonic-dice" class="d-flex  pt-2 flex-row   justify-content-between mt-2">
                            <div class=" d-flex   flex-column  justify-content-between w-100">
                                <p class="justify-content-between">
                                    If you do not trust to any software random number generator due possible bugs or
                                    backdoors, you can generate a
                                    mnemonic code using dice yourself. <u>Critical to security</u> is the use of random
                                    numbers.
                                    Do not try to select words from the mnemonic dictionary in other ways. Even if it
                                    seems
                                    to
                                    you that you are doing this in an unpredictable way, <u>most likely you are
                                    mistaken</u>.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    In the proposed generation scheme, it is most convenient to use 5 cubes at a time.
                                    If
                                    you have only 1 die,
                                    you should make 5 consecutive throws to generate 1 word. With manual code
                                    generation, it
                                    is not possible
                                    to calculate the checksum, which is written at the end in accordance with BIP39. If
                                    the
                                    wallet in which you plan
                                    to use your mnemonic code requires the correct code checksum, then you should adjust
                                    last word to correct
                                    checksum with mnemonic code loader tool.


                                </p>
                                <p>You should select 12 / 15 / 18 / 21 or 24
                                    <small>(recommended)</small>
                                    words using dice rolls and dice wordlist. If your
                                    throw result is not in the list, just ignore and continue. Some combinations are
                                    excluded for uniform
                                    probability distribution.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex flex-row justify-content-center m-2">
